    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0010-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:50:02.765+09:00">在大禹執政的時候，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:50:11.772+09:00">憑著五音來處理政務，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:50:34.823+09:00">懸掛鐘、鼓、磬和鐸，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:50:49.762+09:00">預備好朋鼓，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:51:01.235+09:00">來接待四方人士，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:51:07.377+09:00">發出文告說： </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:52:03.801+09:00">「用道來教育我的，請擊鼓，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:52:08.499+09:00">來使我明白什麼是義的，請敲鐘；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:52:55.063+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:52:59.479+09:00">來告訴我事情的，請搖鈴•，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:53:08.617+09:00">有訴訟事件的，請摧動靶鼓。」</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:53:15.5+09:00">在這個時候, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:53:24.291+09:00">大禹吃一頓飯要起身十次，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:53:40.061+09:00">洗一次頭要多次握著溼髪出來接見言事的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:53:49.783+09:00">為天下人民而辛勞憂愁。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:54:19.358+09:00">在這種情況下還不能表達善意、</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-15a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-10T22:59:39.487+09:00">獻出忠心的，便是這個人的才智不夠。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
